    "text": "By Brad McElhinny ,\n3 hours ago This Monday, West Virginia University’s latest chief financial officer will be starting his new job, although he’ll be arriving with some baggage. When the hiring of Chris Kabourek was announced on April 16, WVU trumpeted his 30 years of fiscal experience in higher education and said “we’ve found a creative, dynamic, forward-looking, and solutions-focused CFO.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
